4.5771-25/75395600_676657019578924_7001247118161678736_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kKTYZTv9f-4Q7kNvwGI8Vw0&_nc_oc=Ado_JBAyyxORYYMM_wsFjL-09pKsZNA10ZPa386TtsaZ0Dbp2bnXrpov9pSTdDGODfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af252EQhDGF34eoPkE7gWd-K1WxWko0JDFLbyWSFjqW5ZQ&oe=69E0CC02"}, "display_name": "Five Nights at Freddy's: Help Wanted", "keywords": ["freddy", "robot", "survival", "horror", "jumpscare"], "long_description": "Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s: Help Wanted is a virtual reality experience for the Oculus Quest. FNaF: HW is a collection of classic and original mini-games set in the Five Nights universe. Survive terrifying encounters with your favorite killer animatronics in a collection of new and classic FIVE NIGHTS AT FREDDY\u2019S\u2122 experiences. \u201cWhere fantasy and fun come to life!\u201d\n\n\nYOU\u2019RE HIRED - Repair claustrophobic ventilation systems, troubleshoot broken animatronics that could activate at any moment, or spend your evenings cowering in the nighttime security guard office. \nCELEBRATE - Confront your favorite killer animatronics including; Freddy, Bonnie, Chica, Foxy, Springtrap, The Mangle, Funtime Foxy, and Circus Baby. \nPIZZA PARTY - Scenes from classic titles have been updated for an immersive VR experience including;  Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s 2, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s 3, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s 4,  and Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s: Sister Location.", "short_description": "Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s: Help Wanted is a virtual reality experience for the Oculus Quest. FNaF: HW is a collection of classic and original mini-games set in the Five Nights universe. Survive terrifying encounters with your favorite killer animatronics in a collection of new and classic FIVE NIGHTS AT FREDDY\u2019S\u2122 experiences. \u201cWhere fantasy and fun come to life!\u201d"}]}, "developer_name": "Steel Wool Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "htt